{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20193","headline":"喜符郎诗有天纵 · 孟郊","name":"喜符郎诗有天纵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"念符不由级，屹得文章阶。\n白玉抽一毫，绿珉已难排。\n偷笔作文章，乞墨潜磨揩。\n海鲸始生尾，试摆蓬壶涡。\n幸当禁止之，勿使恣狂怀。\n自悲无子嗟，喜妬双喈喈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20193.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20193","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}